@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Astro formatting fixtures
+
+These fixtures come from `prettier-plugin-astro` 1.1.0, commit `12c5a89d63227c7992f63a1d4e5ad08baecbf705`.
+The included license covers the copied files.
+
+The API tests compare complete Astro output against the original fixture output.
+They also check that a second formatting pass leaves the output unchanged.
+The tests set `printWidth: 80` to match Prettier's default.
+Oxfmt keeps its normal default of 100 columns.
+
+The additional custom-plugin fixture is outside oxfmt's supported plugin interface.
+It remains here as part of the original fixture set.
